1
00:00:02,711 --> 00:00:03,711
Are you okay?

2
00:00:04,796 --> 00:00:06,214
I'm fine.

3
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:07,268
Why is your hand

4
00:00:07,269 --> 00:00:08,340
shaking so badly?

5
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:10,552
I think I just need a break.

6
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:14,038
Take a break

7
00:00:14,039 --> 00:00:15,039
for a while.

8
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:34,868
What was all that?

9
00:00:35,243 --> 00:00:36,207
You were doing so well

10
00:00:36,208 --> 00:00:37,208
just now.

11
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:38,328
I was forcing myself

12
00:00:38,329 --> 00:00:39,393
to hold it together.

13
00:00:40,081 --> 00:00:41,499
Forcing yourself?

14
00:00:41,499 --> 00:00:43,334
When I was a kid

15
00:00:43,334 --> 00:00:44,669
I took after my parents

16
00:00:44,669 --> 00:00:46,228
so I played better than

17
00:00:46,229 --> 00:00:47,878
most of my friends.

18
00:00:48,381 --> 00:00:49,941
From then, they wanted me

19
00:00:49,942 --> 00:00:51,452
to be the best.

20
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,219
They kept pushing me.

21
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:55,221
They forced me to play

22
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:57,599
fixed notes
with a fixed style.

23
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:58,669
If I made even the smallest

24
00:00:58,670 --> 00:00:59,828
mistake, they'd

25
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:02,274
make me do it over and over

26
00:01:02,275 --> 00:01:03,604
until they were satisfied.

27
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:11,820
Again.
